# Branch strategy

## main 
- deployed branch
## staging 
- testing completed features

## feature branch 
- top level branch for new work implementations awaiting official staging test runs

## todos (largely now managed within this readme file) 

- standalone branch, (wont merge to staging) 
- managing project roadmap organized within the todo's folder 
- broken down to hierarchical readme's (mechanics, level design, character design, etc)




